# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# The formatter requires LF, but with git's default `core.autocrlf=true` on
# Windows every checkout and merge rewrites tracked files to CRLF, which makes
# `pnpm check` fail on files nobody edited. Declaring the policy here keeps the
# working tree, the index, and CI in agreement regardless of platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
